/03/Gift_Cards_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Gift Cards\";s:4:\"copy\";s:495:\"Gift Cards for WooCommerce is the official WooCommerce extension for selling prepaid, multi-purpose digital gift cards that customers redeem online. It supports Simple and Variable gift certificates, expiring codes, custom delivery dates, and multiple recipients, and lets store owners track, search, and report on issued, used, and expired codes. Unlike a coupon, it treats gift cards as prepaid balances for accurate accounting. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/gift-cards/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:35;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:52:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-wholesale-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:29:\"woocommerce-wholesale-pricing\";s:4:\"icon\";s:82:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Wholesale-For-WooCommerce-5.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:41:\"Wholesale For WooCommerce - B2B Ecommerce\";s:4:\"copy\";s:134:\"Run your B2C + B2B eCommerce store with the best AI-Powered WooCommerce B2B plugin for pricing, quotes, bulk orders, and sales agents.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/wholesale-for-woocommerce/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:36;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:69:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-quantity-discounts-pricing-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:42:\"quantity-discounts-pricing-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:85:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/image_2022_08_12T13_26_36_952Z.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"Quantity Discounts & Pricing\";s:4:\"copy\";s:112:\"Enable discounts on quantity ranges or set price per quantity for specific products, categories, and user roles.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:76:\"https://woocommerce.com/p