INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (74,1,'2026-10-30 01:00:51','2026-10-30 01:00:51','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">The Vexora Warden GX90 is designed for players who want to experience modern gaming without compromise. Whether you\'re exploring vast open worlds, competing in fast-paced multiplayer matches, or working with demanding creative applications, the Warden GX90 delivers a performance-focused foundation for your next PC build.</p>\r\n<strong>Cooling Designed for Intense Sessions</strong>\r\n\r\nFeaturing a distinctive triple-fan cooling system, the Warden GX90 is designed to manage heat during demanding workloads. Its large cooling assembly supports consistent thermal management, making it a compelling choice for gaming enthusiasts who spend hours immersed in their favorite titles.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Design That Stands Out</strong>\r\n\r\nWith its dark olive-green finish, gold detailing, and robust construction, the Warden GX90 combines industrial styling with premium visual appeal. The distinctive exterior makes it particularly well suited to custom gaming builds where aesthetics matter just as much as functionality.\r\n\r\n<strong>Made for More Than Gaming</strong>\r\n\r\nBeyond entertainment, the Warden GX90 is aimed at users working with video editing, 3D modeling, digital content creation, and other graphics-intensive applications.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re upgrading an existing system or planning an entirely new build, the Vexora Warden GX90 offers a balance of ambitious performance, cooling-focused design, and distinctive aesthetics.','Vexora Warden GX90','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Take your gaming experience to the next level with the Vexora Warden GX90. Combining powerful graphics performance, an advanced triple-fan cooling design, and a bold premium finish, this graphics card is built for gamers who demand exceptional visuals, smooth gameplay, and dependable performance.</p>','publish','open','closed','','vexora-warden-gx90','','','2026-10-30 01:20:32','2026-10-30 01:20:32','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=74',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (75,1,'2026-10-30 01:17:58','2026-10-30 01:17:58','','Vexora Warden GX90','','inherit','open','closed','','dao-hi-u-cgxl10qqbw4-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:18:54','2026-10-30 01:18:54','',74,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dao-hi-u-cgXl10QqBw4-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (76,1,'2026-10-30 01:26:23','2026-10-30 01:26:23','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Built for Battle. Designed to Stand Out.</strong></p>\r\nThe Vexora Warden GX90 DOOM Edition takes the foundation of the Warden series and transforms it into a statement piece for gaming enthusiasts and collectors.\r\n\r\nCreated for players who want their hardware to reflect their passion for gaming, this special edition combines an aggressive visual design with performance-oriented engineering.\r\n\r\n<strong>Distinctive Collector-Inspired Artwork</strong>\r\n\r\nUnlike traditional graphics cards, the DOOM Edition features an illustrated exterior with dramatic artwork and striking detailing. Its combination of dark green, gold, and vivid imagery creates an instantly recognizable appearance.\r\n\r\nWhether displayed through a transparent PC case panel or installed as part of a themed gaming setup, this card is designed to become the centerpiece of your build.\r\n\r\n<strong>Powerful Cooling for Demanding Games</strong>\r\n\r\nA large cooling assembly with multiple fans helps manage the heat generated during extended gaming sessions. The design prioritizes effective airflow while maintaining the distinctive look of the Warden series.\r\n\r\n<strong>Performance Meets Individuality</strong>\r\n\r\nDesigned for demanding games and graphics-intensive workloads, the Warden GX90 DOOM Edition is intended for users who want a capable graphics solution without sacrificing visual personality.\r\n\r\nIt\'s more than a component upgrade. It\'s a way to turn your gaming PC into something uniquely yours.','Vexora Warden GX90 — DOOM Edition','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Power meets personality with the Vexora Warden GX90 DOOM Edition. Featuring striking artwork, a distinctive collector-inspired design, and the triple-fan cooling system of the Warden series, this special edition brings a bold visual identity to high-performance gaming builds.</p>','publish','open','closed','','vexora-warden-gx90-doom-edition','','','2026-10-30 01:26:23','2026-10-30 01:26:23','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=76',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (77,1,'2026-10-30 01:25:33','2026-10-30 01:25:33','','Vexora Warden GX90 — DOOM Edition','','inherit','open','closed','','dao-hi-u-ecgbpt3uu38-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:25:50','2026-10-30 01:25:50','',76,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dao-hi-u-eCgBPT3uU38-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (78,1,'2026-10-30 01:28:59','2026-10-30 01:28:59','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Balanced Performance for Everything You Do</strong></p>\r\nThe Syntrix Ryzenova R7 370 is built for users who want reliable performance across gaming, work, and everyday computing.\r\n\r\nDesigned to handle a variety of demanding tasks, the Ryzenova R7 370 offers a versatile processing foundation for modern desktop systems.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re playing your favorite games, working with multiple applications, or exploring content creation, this processor is intended to deliver a responsive computing experience.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ready for Modern Gaming</strong>\r\n\r\nA capable processor is essential to any well-balanced gaming PC. The Ryzenova R7 370 is designed to work alongside dedicated graphics hardware, handling game calculations, background applications, and system tasks while you play.\r\n\r\n<strong>More Room for Creativity</strong>\r\n\r\nFrom editing photos and working with digital design tools to managing larger documents and multitasking between applications, the Ryzenova R7 370 is designed for users who need flexibility.\r\n\r\nIts performance-focused architecture makes it a practical choice for students, creators, and gaming enthusiasts alike.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Smart Choice for Your Next Build</strong>\r\n\r\nNot every computer needs to be the most expensive one available. The Ryzenova R7 370 focuses on providing a strong balance between capability, versatility, and value.\r\n\r\nIdeal for both new PC builds and carefully planned upgrades, it offers a solid starting point for a system designed around your needs.','Syntrix Ryzenova R7 370','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Discover a balance of gaming performance and everyday productivity with the Syntrix Ryzenova R7 370. Designed for responsive multitasking, modern gaming, and creative applications, this versatile desktop processor is an excellent starting point for a capable and well-rounded PC.</p>','publish','open','closed','','syntrix-ryzenova-r7-370','','','2026-10-30 01:29:00','2026-10-30 01:29:00','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=78',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (79,1,'2026-10-30 01:27:17','2026-10-30 01:27:17','','Syntrix Ryzenova R7 370','','inherit','open','closed','','olivier-collet-jmwce3w7qkk-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:27:27','2026-10-30 01:27:27','',78,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/olivier-collet-JMwCe3w7qKk-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (80,1,'2026-10-30 01:30:48','2026-10-30 01:30:48','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>High-End Processing for Ambitious Builds</strong></p>\r\nThe Veltrix CoreMax I9 900 is designed for PC enthusiasts, serious gamers, and creators who rely on their systems for demanding work.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re building a gaming powerhouse, a content creation workstation, or a versatile desktop that needs to handle both, the CoreMax I9 900 is positioned as a premium processing solution.\r\n\r\n<strong>Designed for Demanding Workloads</strong>\r\n\r\nModern applications often require a processor to handle several demanding tasks simultaneously. The CoreMax I9 900 focuses on supporting heavy multitasking, intensive applications, and complex computing workloads.\r\n\r\nIts performance-oriented design makes it particularly appealing for users working with video editing, 3D rendering, software development, and other processor-intensive activities.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Strong Foundation for Gaming</strong>\r\n\r\nWhen paired with suitable graphics hardware and memory, the CoreMax I9 900 is designed to support demanding gaming experiences while managing essential background processes.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re competing online, recording gameplay, or working across multiple applications, this processor aims to keep your desktop responsive.\r\n\r\n<strong>For Those Who Need More</strong>\r\n\r\nThe CoreMax I9 900 is intended for users who want their PC to be more than an everyday machine.\r\n\r\nFrom ambitious creative projects to premium gaming setups, it delivers the foundation for a desktop built around performance, versatility, and productivity.\r\n\r\nChoose the Veltrix CoreMax I9 900 when your next PC needs to be ready for more demanding tasks.','Veltrix CoreMax I9 900','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Push your desktop further with the Veltrix CoreMax I9 900. Developed for demanding gaming, intensive multitasking, and professional creative workflows, this high-end processor is designed for users who expect more from their computer.</p>','publish','open','closed','','veltrix-coremax-i9-900','','','2026-10-30 01:30:48','2026-10-30 01:30:48','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=80',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (81,1,'2026-10-30 01:29:32','2026-10-30 01:29:32','','Veltrix CoreMax I9 900','','inherit','open','closed','','christian-wiediger-4iv0z1e2nny-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:29:45','2026-10-30 01:29:45','',80,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/christian-wiediger-4Iv0Z1e2nNY-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (82,1,'2026-10-30 01:33:29','2026-10-30 01:33:29','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>A Clean Foundation for Your Next PC</strong></p>\r\nThe Arclume Frostline T4 combines modern design with practical PC-building considerations.\r\n\r\nCreated for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts, its understated black exterior offers a versatile foundation for a wide range of desktop configurations.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re assembling your first computer or refreshing an existing build, the Frostline T4 helps bring your components together in a visually cohesive setup.\r\n\r\n<strong>Showcase Your Hardware</strong>\r\n\r\nA transparent side panel provides a view of your internal components, making the case especially appealing for builds featuring illuminated fans, custom cooling solutions, and carefully arranged hardware.\r\n\r\nIts clean appearance allows your components to take center stage without overwhelming your desk.\r\n\r\n<strong>Designed with Airflow in Mind</strong>\r\n\r\nEffective cooling is an important consideration in any desktop computer. The Frostline T4 is designed around a ventilated chassis layout that supports airflow through the system when paired with suitable cooling components.\r\n\r\n<strong>Minimalist Styling, Maximum Personality</strong>\r\n\r\nThe combination of a dark exterior, clean geometric lines, and subtle lighting possibilities makes the Frostline T4 suitable for both gaming spaces and professional workstations.\r\n\r\nWhether your setup features bright RGB lighting or a more understated aesthetic, this case offers a flexible starting point.\r\n\r\nBuild something personal with the Arclume Frostline T4.','Arclume Frostline T4','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Clean design meets modern gaming aesthetics with the Arclume Frostline T4. Featuring a sleek black exterior, a transparent side panel, and a spacious-looking interior, this PC case is designed to showcase your components while maintaining a sophisticated and minimalist appearance.</p>','publish','open','closed','','arclume-frostline-t4','','','2026-10-30 01:33:30','2026-10-30 01:33:30','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=82',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (83,1,'2026-10-30 01:31:55','2026-10-30 01:31:55','','Arclume Frostline T4','','inherit','open','closed','','anthony-roberts-5wjhuxkqckc-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:32:06','2026-10-30 01:32:06','',82,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/anthony-roberts-5WJhuXkqCkc-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (84,1,'2026-10-30 01:35:06','2026-10-30 01:35:06','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Built to Impress</strong></p>\r\nThe Nexalis Glacier X7 is a gaming-oriented PC case created for users who want their hardware to make a statement.\r\n\r\nIts dramatic black exterior, transparent viewing panel, and striking blue illuminated cooling fans create a bold look that fits naturally into modern gaming setups.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Showcase for Your Components</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Glacier X7 puts your hardware on display.\r\n\r\nThe transparent side panel offers a clear view into the system, allowing graphics cards, cooling components, and internal lighting to become part of the overall design.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re building a color-coordinated gaming computer or experimenting with a more elaborate setup, the Glacier X7 provides a visually impressive foundation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Cooling-Focused Design</strong>\r\n\r\nMultiple fan mounting positions and an airflow-oriented layout help accommodate the cooling needs of gaming hardware.\r\n\r\nThe large, illuminated fan arrangement gives the case its distinctive appearance while highlighting the importance of airflow in a modern PC build.\r\n\r\n<strong>Create Your Own Gaming Atmosphere</strong>\r\n\r\nWith its bold blue lighting aesthetic and dark housing, the Glacier X7 is particularly suited to gaming rooms, streaming spaces, and immersive desktop environments.\r\n\r\nIts design pairs naturally with illuminated keyboards, accessories, and other gaming equipment.\r\n\r\nFor enthusiasts who want their PC case to be more than a simple enclosure, the Nexalis Glacier X7 brings together visual impact and practical building considerations.','Nexalis Glacier X7','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Make your next PC build impossible to ignore with the Nexalis Glacier X7. Combining an eye-catching illuminated fan design, a dark premium exterior, and a showcase-style side panel, this gaming case is made for builders who appreciate striking aesthetics and cooling-focused design.</p>','publish','open','closed','','nexalis-glacier-x7','','','2026-10-30 01:38:50','2026-10-30 01:38:50','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=84',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (85,1,'2026-10-30 01:34:02','2026-10-30 01:34:02','','Nexalis Glacier X7','','inherit','open','closed','','christian-wiediger-kv2vfoyitcy-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:34:15','2026-10-30 01:34:15','',84,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/christian-wiediger-KV2vFOYItcY-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (86,1,'2026-10-30 01:38:07','2026-10-30 01:38:07','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Your Next Adventure Starts Here</strong></p>\r\nThe Nexalis Halo X9 is designed for gamers who want a complete desktop gaming experience without the complexity of selecting and assembling every individual component.\r\n\r\nCombining performance-oriented hardware with a carefully coordinated exterior design, the Halo X9 is intended to offer an appealing starting point for both passionate gamers and creative users.\r\n\r\n<strong>Designed for Immersive Gaming</strong>\r\n\r\nFrom expansive single-player adventures to competitive multiplayer experiences, the Halo X9 is built around the needs of modern PC gaming.\r\n\r\nIts desktop configuration is intended to support demanding games, multitasking, and everyday activities, making it suitable for users who need one computer for entertainment, productivity, and creativity.\r\n\r\n<strong>Striking Lighting and Premium Aesthetics</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Halo X9 features a bold black chassis with a transparent side panel and bright illuminated cooling fans.\r\n\r\nThe lighting gives the desktop a distinctive futuristic appearance, while the visible internal components create the feeling of a carefully assembled enthusiast PC.\r\n\r\n<strong>Cooling with Style</strong>\r\n\r\nThe multi-fan chassis design supports airflow through the computer, an important consideration when working with performance-focused desktop hardware.\r\n\r\nIts illuminated cooling arrangement provides a distinctive visual identity while complementing the overall build.\r\n\r\n<strong>Gaming and Creativity in One Place</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Halo X9 is intended for more than gaming alone.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re streaming, editing videos, experimenting with 3D design, or working with demanding applications, the system is designed as a versatile desktop for a variety of digital activities.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ready for Your Setup</strong>\r\n\r\nWith its complete desktop format and distinctive design, the Nexalis Halo X9 is a compelling choice for anyone who wants to build a gaming space around a visually striking computer.\r\n\r\nSpend less time planning individual components and more time enjoying your new setup.','Nexalis Halo X9','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Step into your next gaming adventure with the Nexalis Halo X9, a complete gaming desktop designed for immersive gameplay, eye-catching aesthetics, and everyday versatility. With its striking illuminated cooling system and premium black chassis, the Halo X9 brings a powerful gaming atmosphere straight to your desk.</p>','publish','open','closed','','nexalis-halo-x9','','','2026-10-30 01:42:19','2026-10-30 01:42:19','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=86',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (87,1,'2026-10-30 01:36:10','2026-10-30 01:36:10','','Nexalis Halo X9','','inherit','open','closed','','olivier-collet-vdgbfiam6cs-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:36:20','2026-10-30 01:36:20','',86,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/olivier-collet-VDGBFiaM6Cs-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (88,1,'2026-10-30 01:41:16','2026-10-30 01:41:16','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Compact Design, Everyday Versatility</strong></p>\r\nThe Keyvora Ember 75 is created for users who want a capable keyboard without taking up unnecessary desk space.\r\n\r\nIts compact 75% layout brings commonly used keys together in a smaller format, making it a practical choice for gaming environments, student workstations, and minimalist desktop setups.\r\n\r\n<strong>More Space for What Matters</strong>\r\n\r\nA compact keyboard leaves additional room for mouse movement and other desktop essentials.\r\n\r\nThis makes the Ember 75 particularly appealing for gamers who prefer generous mouse space, as well as users working with limited desk areas.\r\n\r\nDespite its smaller footprint, the layout retains many of the familiar functions found on larger keyboards.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Bold, Minimalist Appearance</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Ember 75 features a dark keyboard body with contrasting orange accent keys that give it a distinctive visual identity.\r\n\r\nIts understated appearance is complemented by small design details, making it suitable for both gaming-focused setups and modern workspaces.\r\n\r\n<strong>Comfortable for Gaming and Productivity</strong>\r\n\r\nDesigned for everyday typing and interactive use, the Ember 75 is suited to a variety of activities, from writing assignments and coding to chatting and gaming.\r\n\r\nIts compact arrangement keeps frequently used keys within easy reach.\r\n\r\n<strong>An Easy Addition to Your Setup</strong>\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re creating a streamlined workspace or upgrading your gaming accessories, the Keyvora Ember 75 offers a balance of visual personality and practical design.\r\n\r\nA compact keyboard that fits naturally into the way you work and play.','Keyvora Ember 75','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Small footprint. Big personality. The Keyvora Ember 75 combines a compact 75% keyboard layout with striking orange accents and a clean, modern appearance. Designed for gaming and everyday productivity, it brings together practical functionality and minimalist desktop style.</p>','publish','open','closed','','keyvora-ember-75','','','2026-10-30 01:41:16','2026-10-30 01:41:16','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=88',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (89,1,'2026-10-30 01:39:23','2026-10-30 01:39:23','','Keyvora Ember 75','','inherit','open','closed','','stefen-tan-kyw1eux1j7y-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:39:36','2026-10-30 01:39:36','',88,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/stefen-tan-KYw1eUx1J7Y-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (90,1,'2026-10-30 01:44:27','2026-10-30 01:44:27','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Clean Design. Practical Performance.</strong></p>\r\nThe Keyvora Slate TKL is designed for users who appreciate a straightforward keyboard with an emphasis on usability, space efficiency, and visual simplicity.\r\n\r\nIts tenkeyless layout removes the traditional numeric keypad while retaining the familiar main keyboard arrangement, making it an appealing choice for both gamers and everyday computer users.\r\n\r\n<strong>A More Spacious Desktop</strong>\r\n\r\nWithout a dedicated number pad, the Slate TKL occupies less room than a conventional full-size keyboard.\r\n\r\nThe smaller footprint provides additional space for mouse movement, desk accessories, and other essentials.\r\n\r\nIt is especially suited to compact setups where efficient use of space matters.\r\n\r\n<strong>Timeless, Understated Styling</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Slate TKL features a refined combination of grey and black keycaps, complemented by distinctive red accent keys.\r\n\r\nIts restrained color palette creates a professional appearance with just enough personality to stand out.\r\n\r\nWhether paired with a bright gaming PC or a minimalist office setup, the Slate TKL integrates naturally into a variety of environments.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ready for Work and Play</strong>\r\n\r\nThe familiar keyboard arrangement makes the Slate TKL suitable for typing, browsing, gaming, and general productivity.\r\n\r\nIts combination of standard functionality and space-saving design allows users to move comfortably between activities without needing a large keyboard.\r\n\r\n<strong>Simplicity That Works</strong>\r\n\r\nNot every accessory needs excessive decoration or an oversized design.\r\n\r\nThe Keyvora Slate TKL focuses on delivering a clean aesthetic, a familiar typing layout, and a practical footprint.\r\n\r\nA versatile keyboard for users who want their setup to feel organized, comfortable, and personal.','Keyvora Slate TKL','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Minimalist design meets everyday functionality with the Keyvora Slate TKL. Featuring a tenkeyless layout, contrasting keycaps, and a timeless grey-and-black finish with red accents, this keyboard is a versatile addition to both gaming stations and modern workspaces.</p>','publish','open','closed','','keyvora-slate-tkl','','','2026-10-30 01:44:27','2026-10-30 01:44:27','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=90',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (91,1,'2026-10-30 01:43:06','2026-10-30 01:43:06','','Keyvora Slate TKL','','inherit','open','closed','','jl-cabrera-p5rgcefioh0-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:43:15','2026-10-30 01:43:15','',90,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/jl-cabrera-p5rgceFiOH0-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (92,1,'2026-10-30 01:48:20','2026-10-30 01:48:20','<strong>Precision Meets Style</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Pulseon Neon Glide M8 is designed for gamers who want reliable control without sacrificing aesthetics. With its streamlined silhouette, responsive feel, and eye-catching RGB lighting, this mouse is a strong addition to any gaming desk or modern PC setup.\r\n\r\n<strong>Comfort for Long Sessions</strong>\r\n\r\nA good gaming mouse should feel natural in the hand, even during extended use. The Neon Glide M8 features a curved ergonomic shape that supports comfortable grip and smooth movement, making it suitable for long gaming sessions, everyday browsing, and productivity tasks alike.\r\n\r\n<strong>Confident Grip and Control</strong>\r\n\r\nTextured side panels help improve grip and handling, giving the mouse a more secure feel during quick movements and precise adjustments. Whether you\'re making fast reactions in competitive games or navigating detailed creative work, the design focuses on stability and control.\r\n\r\n<strong>RGB Lighting That Stands Out</strong>\r\n\r\nOne of the most distinctive features of the Neon Glide M8 is its illuminated RGB edge lighting. The vibrant glow adds a futuristic gaming look while helping the mouse feel visually connected to the rest of an RGB-focused setup. It’s a great fit for users who want their accessories to contribute to the overall atmosphere of their desk.\r\n\r\n<strong>Versatile for Gaming and Everyday Use</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Neon Glide M8 is suited to a wide range of uses, from gaming and streaming to studying, working, and general computer use. Its combination of visual flair and practical design makes it a flexible choice for users who want one mouse that feels capable across multiple activities.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Stylish Upgrade for Your Setup</strong>\r\n\r\nIf you\'re looking for a mouse that combines comfort, control, and strong visual identity, the Pulseon Neon Glide M8 is an excellent option. It offers a premium gaming-inspired appearance while remaining practical enough for everyday use.','Pulseon Neon Glide M8','Bring precision and personality to your setup with the Pulseon Neon Glide M8. Featuring a sleek ergonomic shape, textured side grips, and vibrant RGB lighting, this gaming mouse is designed for smooth control, long-session comfort, and a bold modern look.','publish','open','closed','','pulseon-neon-glide-m8','','','2026-10-30 01:48:20','2026-10-30 01:48:20','',0,'http://lumen-nook.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=92',0,'product','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (93,1,'2026-10-30 01:46:34','2026-10-30 01:46:34','','Pulseon Neon Glide M8','','inherit','open','closed','','nerfee-mirandilla-2mbkkeklhbi-unsplash','','','2026-10-30 01:46:46','2026-10-30 01:46:46','',92,'http://lumen-nook.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/nerfee-mirandilla-2mBKkeklHbI-unsplash.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
